ed PEG-folate in KB and A549 cells (<bold>A</bold>) and the study on contrast using PEG, PEG-folate and PEGfolate with folic acid in the KB cells (<bold>B</bold>). Data represent the means of three independent experiments&#x000b1;SD (<sup>*</sup>, <italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.05).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-405-g005"/></fig><fig id="F6" position="float"><label>Fig. 6</label><caption><p>Representative images of a mouse treated with <sup>99m</sup>Tc PEG-folate (<bold>A</bold>) and the competition images with folic acid (<bold>B</bold>).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-405-g006"/></fig><fig id="F7" position="float"><label>Fig. 7</label><caption><p>Intensity comparison and analysis between tumor and non-tumor. Data represent the means of three independent experiments&#x000b1;SD.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-405-g007"/></fig></floats-group></article>